        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We disclosed in our Final Prospectus that while we may pursue an initial business combination target in any business or industry, we intended to focus our efforts on technology enabled businesses that directly or indirectly offer specific technology solutions, broader technology software and services, or financial services to companies of all sizes.",
        "start_character": 452,
        "end_character": 803
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-010274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-010274-22db482be60e1359",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-010274",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We will remain an emerging growth company until the earlier of (1) the last day of the fiscal year (a) following the fifth anniversary of the completion of the Initial Public Offering, (b) in which we have total annual gross revenue of at least $1.235 billion, or (c) in which we are deemed to be a large accelerated filer, which means the market value of the Class A Shares that are held by non-affiliates exceeds $700 million as of the prior June 30, and (2) the date on which we have issued more than $1.0 billion in non-convertible debt securities during the prior three-year period.",
        "start_character": 19812,
        "end_character": 20399
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-010274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-010274-22db482be60e1359",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-010274",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We believe that our Founder and directors have developed a unique set of capabilities that will provide us with a proprietary list of potential acquisition opportunities, including",
        "start_character": 8373,
        "end_character": 8553
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-010274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-010274-22db482be60e1359",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-010274",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "Although we are not constrained to any specific sub-sector, we believe that there are multiple continuing secular trends in fintech, software and business services that may lead to an emphasis on those sub-sectors.",
        "start_character": 5809,
        "end_character": 6023
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-010274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-010274-22db482be60e1359",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-010274",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "The amount of time he will devote in any time period will vary based on whether a target business has been selected for our initial business combination and the stage of the initial business combination process we are in.",
        "start_character": 21500,
        "end_character": 21721
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-010274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-010274-22db482be60e1359",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-010274",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are an “emerging growth company,” as defined in Section 2(a) of the Securities Act of 1933, as amended (the “Securities Act”), as modified by the Jumpstart Our Business Startups Act of 2012 (the “JOBS Act”).",
        "start_character": 18259,
        "end_character": 18469
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-010274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-010274-22db482be60e1359",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-010274",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We are not prohibited from pursuing an initial business combination with a business that is affiliated with our Sponsor, officers or directors.",
        "start_character": 14923,
        "end_character": 15066
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-010274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-010274-22db482be60e1359",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-010274",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.9,
        "statement": "We believe software businesses have multiple supportive market and intrinsic business fundamentals that will continue to attract capital.",
        "start_character": 7474,
        "end_character": 7611
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-010274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-010274-22db482be60e1359",
