        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "Additionally, we are a “smaller reporting company” as defined in Item 10(f)(1) of Regulation S-K.",
        "start_character": 20505,
        "end_character": 20602
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001140361-26-010274",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001140361-26-010274-22db482be60e1359",
        "accession_number": "0001140361-26-010274",
        "filing_date": "2026-03-19",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.86,
        "statement": "As such, we are eligible to take advantage of certain exemptions from various reporting requirements that are applicable to other public companies that are not “emerging growth companies” including, but not limited to, not being required to comply with the auditor attestation requirements of Section 404 of the Sarbanes-Oxley Act of 2002 (the “Sarbanes-Oxley Act”), reduced disclosure obligations regarding executive compensation in our periodic reports and proxy statements, and exemptions from the requirements of holding a non-binding advisory vote on executive compensation and shareholder approval of any golden parachute payments not previously approved.",
